unit: manifest entry
id: has_wwan_hotspot
_name: WWAN module used as a USB hotspot
_prompt:
  Does this device have a WWAN module, attached as a USB cdc-acm
  device, that brings up its data connection with raw AT commands over
  its serial control interface (WWAN_CONTROL_IF) instead of through
  ModemManager?
value-type: bool
